        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Hawaiian religion</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 800 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Origin</span><span class="info-stat-val">The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hawaii">Hawaiian Islands</a>, brought by Tahitians and other Pacific Islanders who landed there between 500 and 1300 CE; there is significant evidence of settlement no later than 800 CE, with immigration continuing to about 1300 CE, from the Marquesas and greater <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/polynesia">Polynesia</a>.</span></div>
